{# roomhive/host/listings.html.twig
   Host › My Listings — 1:1 port of legacy user/mylistings.php
   (the card-style manager: cover photo + status pill + "Price
   Locked" badge, ₱/month, bookings stat line, applicant/occupied
   strip, Edit Listing link). Extends host/base.html.twig;
   sidebar "My Listings" highlights via active_nav = 'listings'.

   Legacy hostprofile.css classes (hp-page-header, hp-mylisting-*,
   hp-empty-state...) are rebuilt as page-local CSS below — that
   stylesheet was never part of the Symfony port. The status pill
   values are the same ones host/profile.html.twig uses.

   THE 3-DOT KEBAB MENU WAS REMOVED from this page (request:
   "delete the 3 dot and add the edit listing"):
     • Accept Tenant / Reject Tenant → the Pending Tenants page
       owns that flow (host/pending-tenants.html.twig — the
       sign-to-accept flow, POST /host/bookings/{id}/accept|reject
       via AcceptBookingController). The applicant strip is now a
       LINK to /host/pending-tenants so "awaiting your decision"
       still has a one-click path to act.
     • Delete Listing → NOW PORTED as a real action (request:
       "add i can delete the space"). HostDeleteListingController,
       POST /host/listings/{id}/delete with a confirm dialog +
       per-session CSRF (_rh_csrf_tokens['host_listing_delete'],
       seeded by HostListingsController). Same lock as Edit:
       while has_active_booking (reserved OR occupied) the
       button renders locked and non-navigating; the endpoint
       re-checks ownership + the lock server-side and cleans up
       reviews / wishlist / bookings / photos inside one
       transaction (conversations just lose their listing_id).
       Result comes back as GET flags: ?deleted=1 (green banner)
       or ?delete_error=occupied|csrf|notfound|failed (red).

   REAL STATS (request: "make bookings views and ratings works"):
     • Bookings — confirmed + completed count (was already real).
     • Views — listings.views column (NOT in the legacy dump;
       self-healed on first run), incremented by
       ListingsController::detail on every detail-page visit.
     • Rating — AVG(reviews.rating) + review count per listing;
       renders "—" while the listing has no reviews yet.

   Occupied vs. "has active booking" (two controller-provided
   flags, they are NOT the same):
     has_active_booking = a pending (paid reserve, awaiting
       decision) OR confirmed booking exists → drives the
       "Price Locked" badge (legacy semantics: price and
       availability lock while booked or reserving).
     is_occupied = a CONFIRMED booking exists → someone actually
       lives in the space right now → drives the occupied-guard
       features below ("can edit if no one occupied").

   Actions:
     • Cover photo + listing title link to the public detail
       page (/listings/{id}, app_listing_detail — same hardcoded
       URL style as host/messages.html.twig): "click to see the
       details".
     • Edit Listing → /host/listings/edit?id=N
       (REAL route now — HostEditListingController, the port of
       legacy user/edit-listing.php). Still gated CLIENT-SIDE:
       while the space is occupied the link is replaced by a
       locked, non-navigating button that explains itself on
       click; the edit page re-checks the lock server-side.
     • Applicant strip → /host/pending-tenants (accept/reject
       live there).
     • Add New Listing → /host/become-a-host (legacy becomeahost.php)

   Pairs with: HostListingsController (route /host/listings,
   route name app_host_listings, GET only — the legacy page has
   no POST handling of its own).
#}
{% extends 'host/base.html.twig' %}
{% import 'admin/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}

{% set active_nav = 'listings' %}

{% block page_title %}My Listings — RoomHive{% endblock %}

{% block styles %}
    <style>
        /* ---- Page header ---- */
        .hp-page-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .hp-page-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--rh-ink);
        }
        .hp-page-subtitle {
            margin: 4px 0 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
            max-width: 640px;
        }

        /* ---- Status pills (same values as host/profile.html.twig) ---- */
        .hp-status {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .hp-status-active {
            background: #e7f7ec;
            color: #1fa971;
        }
        .hp-status-pending {
            background: var(--rh-accent-light);
            color: #b07708;
        }
        .hp-status-rejected {
            background: #fceaea;
            color: #e14b4b;
        }
        .hp-status-unlisted {
            background: #f0f1f6;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
        }

        /* ---- Empty state ---- */
        .hp-empty-state {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 56px 20px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px dashed var(--rh-line);
            border-radius: var(--rh-radius);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
        }
        .hp-empty-state p {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .hp-empty-state-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--rh-ink);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        /* ---- Listing cards ---- */
        .hp-mylistings-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
            border-radius: var(--rh-radius);
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-img-wrap {
            position: relative;
            width: 200px;
            height: 132px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #f0eee6;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        /* ---- Click-through to the detail page (cover + title) ---- */
        .hp-mylisting-img-link {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-img-link:hover .hp-mylisting-img {
            opacity: 0.92;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-title-link {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-title-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .hp-mylisting-info {
            flex: 1 1 200px;
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-info h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--rh-ink);
        }
        .hp-mylisting-price-row {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
        }
        .hp-mylisting-price {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--rh-ink);
            margin-right: 2px;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-stats {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 7px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-stat-line {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
        }
        .hp-mylisting-stat-line b {
            color: var(--rh-ink);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-left: auto;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* ---- Applicant / occupied strip (legacy values; spans the
                                    card's second row via flex-basis) ---- */
        .hp-mylisting-applicant {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            flex-basis: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            background: #fff4e0;
            border: 1px solid #f7941d;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8a5a10;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-applicant svg {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* ---- Applicant strip as a link to Pending Tenants (the
                                    kebab's Accept/Reject live there now) ---- */
        a.hp-mylisting-applicant {
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: filter 0.15s ease;
        }
        a.hp-mylisting-applicant:hover {
            filter: brightness(0.97);
        }
        .hp-applicant-chev {
            margin-left: auto;
            color: #b07708;
        }

        /* ---- "Price Locked" badge (exact legacy values) ---- */
        .hp-locked-badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.85);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 10.5px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .hp-locked-badge svg {
            width: 11px;
            height: 11px;
        }

        /* ---- Occupied guard: Edit locked (only fires while
                                    is_occupied) ---- */
        .hp-edit-locked {
            font-family: inherit;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
            background: #f6f7fb;
            border-color: var(--rh-line);
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }
        .hp-edit-locked:hover {
            background: #f6f7fb;
        }

        /* ---- Danger action: Delete (port of legacy
                                    delete-listing.php; same lock as edit) ---- */
        .hp-btn-danger {
            color: #e14b4b;
            border-color: #f3c1c1;
        }
        a.hp-btn-danger:hover,
        button.hp-btn-danger:hover {
            background: #fdf0f0;
        }
        .hp-delete-form {
            display: inline-flex;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .hp-delete-locked {
            font-family: inherit;
            color: var(--rh-muted);
            background: #f6f7fb;
            border-color: var(--rh-line);
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }
        .hp-delete-locked:hover {
            background: #f6f7fb;
        }

        /* ---- Delete result banners (?deleted=1 / ?delete_error=…) ---- */
        .hp-flash {
            padding: 11px 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        .hp-flash-success {
            background: #e7f7ec;
            border: 1px solid #bfe8cf;
            color: #1fa971;
        }
        .hp-flash-error {
            background: #fceaea;
            border: 1px solid #f3c1c1;
            color: #e14b4b;
        }

        /* ---- Icon sizing (legacy: bare-svg descendants; the macro
                                    prints svg.icon so these selectors hit either way) ---- */
        svg.icon {
            display: inline-block;
            vertical-align: -0.18em;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .hp-mylisting-location svg,
        .hp-mylisting-stat-line svg {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            color: #8b93a6;
        }
        .hp-btn-outline {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }
        .hp-btn-outline svg {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
        }

        /* ---- Dark mode ---- */
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-page-title {
            color: #e8ecf1;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-mylisting-card {
            background: #141b24;
            border-color: #1a222b;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-mylisting-info h3 {
            color: #e8ecf1;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-mylisting-price {
            color: #e8ecf1;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-mylisting-stat-line b {
            color: #e8ecf1;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-empty-state {
            background: #141b24;
            border-color: #1a222b;
            color: #8d99a5;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-empty-state-title {
            color: #e8ecf1;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-edit-locked,
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-edit-locked:hover {
            background: #1a222b;
            border-color: #232d38;
            color: #8d99a5;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-delete-locked,
        body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-delete-locked:hover {
            background: #1a222b;
            border-color: #232d38;
            color: #8d99a5;
        }
        body[data-theme="dark"] a.hp-btn-danger:hover,
        body[data-theme="dark"] button.hp-btn-danger:hover {
            background: #2a1a1c;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="hp-page-header">
        <div>
            <h1 class="hp-page-title">My Listings</h1>
            <p class="hp-page-subtitle">Manage your properties — edit details anytime; price and availability lock while a guest is booked or reserving.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/host/become-a-host" class="hp-btn-outline">
            {{ ui.icon('plus') }} Add New Listing
        </a>
    </div>

    {% if deleted %}
        <div class="hp-flash hp-flash-success">Listing deleted — its photos, bookings, reviews and wishlist saves were removed too.</div>
    {% elseif delete_error == 'occupied' %}
        <div class="hp-flash hp-flash-error">This space is reserved or occupied — it can't be deleted until the booking ends.</div>
    {% elseif delete_error == 'csrf' %}
        <div class="hp-flash hp-flash-error">Your session expired — please try again.</div>
    {% elseif delete_error %}
        <div class="hp-flash hp-flash-error">Could not delete the listing — it may not exist or may not be yours. Please try again.</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="hp-mylistings-list">
        {% if listings is empty %}

            <div class="hp-empty-state">
                <p class="hp-empty-state-title">No listings yet</p>
                <p>Click "Add New Listing" above to publish your first property.</p>
            </div>

        {% else %}
            {% for l in listings %}
                <div class="hp-mylisting-card">
                    <div class="hp-mylisting-img-wrap">
                        <a href="/listings/{{ l.id }}" class="hp-mylisting-img-link" title="See the details" aria-label="See the details of {{ l.title }}">
                            <img
                                class="hp-mylisting-img"
                                src="{{ l.cover_photo }}"
                                alt="{{ l.title }}"
                                onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/ListingPlaceholder.png';"
                            >
                        </a>
                        <span class="hp-status {{ l.status_class }}" style="position:absolute; top:10px; left:10px;">
                            {{ l.status_label }}
                        </span>
                        {% if l.has_active_booking %}
                            <span class="hp-locked-badge">
                                {{ ui.icon('lock') }} Price Locked
                            </span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    <div class="hp-mylisting-info">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="/listings/{{ l.id }}" class="hp-mylisting-title-link" title="See the details">{{ l.title }}</a>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="hp-mylisting-location">
                            {{ ui.icon('pin') }}
                            {{ l.location }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="hp-mylisting-price-row">
                            <span class="hp-mylisting-price">&#8369; {{ l.price|number_format }}</span>
                            <span> / month</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="hp-mylisting-stats">
                        <div class="hp-mylisting-stat-line">
                            {{ ui.icon('calendar') }}
                            Bookings <b>{{ l.booking_count }}</b>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hp-mylisting-stat-line">
                            {{ ui.icon('eye') }}
                            Views <b>{{ l.view_count }}</b>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hp-mylisting-stat-line">
                            {{ ui.icon('star') }}
                            {% if l.rating_count > 0 %}
                                Rating <b>{{ l.rating_avg|number_format(1) }}</b> ({{ l.rating_count }})
                            {% else %}
                                Rating <b>&mdash;</b>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {% if l.pending_booking_id %}
                        <a href="/host/pending-tenants" class="hp-mylisting-applicant" title="Decide on the Pending Tenants page">
                            {{ ui.icon('user-plus') }}
                            {{ l.pending_tenant_name }} applied &mdash; awaiting your decision
                            <span class="hp-applicant-chev">{{ ui.icon('chevron-right') }}</span>
                        </a>
                    {% elseif l.is_occupied %}
                        <p class="hp-mylisting-applicant" style="background:#E8F8F1; border-color:#1FA971; color:#1FA971;">
                            {{ ui.icon('shield') }}
                            Currently occupied — price and availability locked
                        </p>
                    {% endif %}

                    <div class="hp-mylisting-actions">
                        {# EDIT — only while nobody occupies the space
                       ("can edit if no one occupied"). While occupied
                       this renders as a locked, non-navigating button
                       that explains itself on click. The edit page
                       (HostEditListingController) re-checks the lock
                       server-side. #}
                        {% if l.is_occupied %}
                            <button type="button" class="hp-btn-outline hp-edit-locked" data-listing-title="{{ l.title }}" aria-disabled="true" title="Editing is disabled while the space is occupied">
                                {{ ui.icon('lock') }} Edit Listing
                            </button>
                        {% else %}
                            <a href="/host/listings/edit?id={{ l.id }}" class="hp-btn-outline">
                                {{ ui.icon('pencil') }} Edit Listing
                            </a>
                        {% endif %}

                        {# DELETE — port of legacy delete-listing.php
                       (HostDeleteListingController, POST
                       /host/listings/{id}/delete). Same lock as
                       edit: while the space is reserved OR occupied
                       (has_active_booking) the button renders
                       locked; the endpoint re-checks the lock +
                       ownership + CSRF server-side. #}
                        {% if l.has_active_booking %}
                            <button type="button" class="hp-btn-outline hp-btn-danger hp-delete-locked" aria-disabled="true" title="Deleting is disabled while the space is reserved or occupied">
                                {{ ui.icon('trash') }} Delete
                            </button>
                        {% else %}
                            <form method="post" action="/host/listings/{{ l.id }}/delete" class="hp-delete-form" data-listing-title="{{ l.title }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_host_listing_delete }}">
                                <button type="submit" class="hp-btn-outline hp-btn-danger">
                                    {{ ui.icon('trash') }} Delete
                                </button>
                            </form>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    <script>
        /* =========================================================
                               PAGE ACTIONS —
                               • EDIT LOCK: occupied spaces cannot be edited.
                                 Accept/Reject live on the Pending Tenants page
                                 (whose endpoint, AcceptBookingController, also
                                 re-checks occupancy server-side).
                               • DELETE: port of legacy delete-listing.php —
                                 confirm dialog before POST; locked while the
                                 space is reserved or occupied.
                            ========================================================= */
        (function () {
            document.querySelectorAll(".hp-edit-locked").forEach(function (btn) {
                btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    alert(
                        "Editing is disabled while this space is occupied.\n\nYou can edit the listing again once nobody is staying in it.",
                    );
                });
            });

            document.querySelectorAll(".hp-delete-locked").forEach(function (btn) {
                btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    alert(
                        "Deleting is disabled while this space is reserved or occupied.\n\nOnce the booking ends and nobody is staying in it, you can delete the listing.",
                    );
                });
            });

            document.querySelectorAll(".hp-delete-form").forEach(function (form) {
                form.addEventListener("submit", function (e) {
                    var title =
                        form.getAttribute("data-listing-title") || "this listing";
                    if (
                        !window.confirm(
                            'Delete "' +
                                title +
                                '" permanently?\n\nThis also removes its photos, bookings, reviews and wishlist saves. This cannot be undone.',
                        )
                    ) {
                        e.preventDefault();
                    }
                });
            });
        })();
    </script>
{% endblock %}
